WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.420 --> 01:42.340
[Episode 4]

01:51.430 --> 01:52.290
Who pushed me?

01:52.430 --> 01:53.050
Senior...

01:53.790 --> 01:56.020
My adventure is so thrilling.

01:56.040 --> 01:57.540
That's your reaction?

01:57.920 --> 01:59.660
It didn't sound thrilling at all.

01:59.760 --> 02:01.540
Everything was clearly under control.

02:02.040 --> 02:03.410
No suspense at all.

02:04.430 --> 02:07.020
Alright. Since you say so,

02:08.080 --> 02:09.130
Pop quiz!

02:09.360 --> 02:10.290
A test?

02:10.310 --> 02:10.980
Question:

02:11.710 --> 02:12.690
[Restrain Words and Deeds]
If Yuan Qing succeeds

02:12.710 --> 02:13.690
and takes Junior Xuanya hostage,

02:13.710 --> 02:16.570
how will he explain when he returns?

02:16.590 --> 02:17.500
How will he explain?

02:18.030 --> 02:18.540
He...

02:19.560 --> 02:20.100
He...

02:21.590 --> 02:23.130
Senior, tell me the answer.

02:24.310 --> 02:25.940
Yuan Qing didn't confess,

02:25.960 --> 02:28.290
but if Skyrend loses
this immortal seedling,

02:28.310 --> 02:30.570
beneficiaries won't
just be outsiders.

02:30.590 --> 02:31.570
Yuan Qing is deeply cunning,

02:31.590 --> 02:32.780
yet he dares to act like that.

02:32.800 --> 02:34.780
There must be someone behind him.

02:35.910 --> 02:36.690
Kuai Si.

02:36.710 --> 02:39.410
You're right; for once you're clever.

02:39.590 --> 02:42.570
Kuai Si is power-hungry, aiming to rise.

02:42.590 --> 02:43.940
If Yuan Qing succeeds,

02:43.960 --> 02:45.380
Skyrend will naturally decline.

02:45.400 --> 02:48.450
Then Mistveil will rise and dominate.

02:48.470 --> 02:49.940
By then, Kuai Si

02:49.960 --> 02:52.220
can spin it as they please.

02:53.190 --> 02:54.730
But they never expected

02:54.750 --> 02:56.890
you in this game, Senior.

02:56.910 --> 02:58.290
Another question.

02:59.750 --> 03:01.780
Yuan Qing praised his hidden weapon

03:01.800 --> 03:03.410
as if it were unmatched.

03:03.430 --> 03:06.100
Why was I unharmed?

03:06.960 --> 03:07.730
Exactly.

03:08.560 --> 03:10.100
Why did it not affect you?

03:10.120 --> 03:11.730
I told you before.

03:11.910 --> 03:15.660
A trump card must stay hidden.

03:16.030 --> 03:19.100
Once exposed, the risk grows tenfold.

03:19.430 --> 03:20.940
In fact, three years ago,

03:21.150 --> 03:22.450
he used it once already.

03:22.960 --> 03:24.340
Perhaps he forgot.

03:24.840 --> 03:25.780
Or perhaps

03:26.560 --> 03:28.450
he never cared about those juniors

03:29.000 --> 03:29.780
at all.

03:31.080 --> 03:32.540
Yuan Man's death was too strange.

03:32.840 --> 03:35.290
His cultivation base was ruined.

03:35.800 --> 03:36.890
I searched for a long time

03:37.120 --> 03:39.610
only to find a needle mark in his neck.

03:39.800 --> 03:41.060
That confirmed my suspicion.

03:41.560 --> 03:42.980
The Mistveil Division

03:43.000 --> 03:45.220
hides a sinister hidden weapon.

03:46.400 --> 03:47.570
The vanishing needle.

03:47.590 --> 03:49.850
I searched many books,

03:50.310 --> 03:51.290
and only in a book recording

03:51.310 --> 03:53.340
ancient demon beasts

03:53.360 --> 03:54.540
did I find it.

03:55.150 --> 03:56.500
It's called Gnatsting Needle.

03:56.840 --> 04:01.130
It's a Blood Gnat's weapon.

04:01.150 --> 04:02.260
It dissolves on blood contact.

04:02.470 --> 04:04.380
It can damage the foundation

04:04.400 --> 04:06.540
and kill invisibly.

04:07.120 --> 04:08.660
If Yuan Qing's attempt hadn't failed,

04:08.680 --> 04:10.010
I wouldn't have picked this up.

04:10.030 --> 04:11.450
Then, I wouldn't have known

04:11.470 --> 04:13.380
what this weapon really is.

04:13.680 --> 04:15.260
What a deadly weapon!

04:15.630 --> 04:17.100
Senior, how did you block it?

04:19.070 --> 04:20.220
That's because

04:20.800 --> 04:21.610
I have

04:22.560 --> 04:23.340
this thing.

04:23.830 --> 04:24.410
This?

04:25.000 --> 04:26.660
This is my secret formula.

04:26.680 --> 04:28.540
It's called Stonehard Elixir.

04:28.630 --> 04:29.410
After taking it,

04:29.430 --> 04:31.810
it makes your skin hard as iron

04:31.830 --> 04:33.250
for four hours.

04:33.680 --> 04:34.610
Only four hours?

04:34.630 --> 04:35.610
Then Senior, how did you know

04:35.630 --> 04:36.810
when he would stab you?

04:36.830 --> 04:38.020
Of course, I didn't know.

04:38.040 --> 04:39.580
So, for these three years,

04:39.800 --> 04:43.100
I took it every four hours.

04:46.870 --> 04:47.700
What's that ringing?

04:52.070 --> 04:53.020
The alarm clock.

04:54.830 --> 04:55.610
Senior,

04:55.680 --> 04:57.610
you're so steady.

04:59.160 --> 04:59.930
Another question.

04:59.950 --> 05:00.410
Another question?

05:00.430 --> 05:02.290
In the Miasma Grove,

05:02.310 --> 05:03.780
I encountered a trace of Resonance.

05:05.510 --> 05:06.290
This person...

05:13.630 --> 05:13.930
Senior?

05:13.950 --> 05:15.020
What's your question, Senior?

05:15.040 --> 05:16.250
What? What question?

05:16.430 --> 05:17.220
What question?

05:18.830 --> 05:19.610
Question?

05:21.950 --> 05:22.850
No question.

05:23.000 --> 05:23.780
Not important.

05:23.830 --> 05:25.460
What's important now is

05:26.830 --> 05:27.700
this thing.

05:30.830 --> 05:32.540
This Sky-Scraping Vine leaf
is so precious?

05:32.680 --> 05:33.900
What do you know?

05:34.240 --> 05:36.660
I spent decades seeking.

05:36.680 --> 05:38.460
Only then did I grasp its wondrous use.

05:38.830 --> 05:39.610
Wondrous use?

05:40.390 --> 05:42.050
Senior, what's it used for?

05:42.630 --> 05:43.490
You feel like scripture copying?

05:43.800 --> 05:45.220
I was just asking.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.020
Five hundred times.

05:46.310 --> 05:46.810
Five...

05:46.830 --> 05:47.580
Go on.

05:56.560 --> 05:57.490
Fine, I'll copy them.

05:59.870 --> 06:02.370
I took only one leaf
from the Sky-Scraping Vine,

06:03.190 --> 06:05.700
leaving the rest for that woman.

06:06.190 --> 06:07.980
She shouldn't come looking for me again.

06:10.560 --> 06:12.050
She also wants the Sky-Scraping Vine.

06:13.040 --> 06:14.610
Does she want to ascend

06:15.830 --> 06:16.700
to heaven like me?

06:42.560 --> 06:43.490
The Sky-Scraping Vine

06:44.360 --> 06:45.660
can pierce the earth and reach heaven.

06:46.830 --> 06:48.490
Yet it can only reach the Ninth Heaven.

06:48.830 --> 06:50.410
It can't reach higher.

06:52.560 --> 06:53.900
I burned up the Sky-Scraping Vine.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.370
But I can't see you one more time.

06:57.870 --> 06:59.490
Why don't you dare see me?

07:13.870 --> 07:16.850
It should be purified nine times

07:17.430 --> 07:21.170
and extracted with water
to get a better effect.

07:22.800 --> 07:23.850
So complicated.

07:24.480 --> 07:26.100
[No Action]
This is too precious.

07:26.630 --> 07:27.730
If taken improperly,

07:27.750 --> 07:30.140
all the efforts will go to waste.

07:31.830 --> 07:33.140
Judging by the flame,

07:33.630 --> 07:35.460
an hour should do it.

07:35.480 --> 07:36.980
What are you saying?

07:38.070 --> 07:38.980
Do you two know

07:39.000 --> 07:40.810
there's the Summary Assembly?

07:40.830 --> 07:42.170
The Hall of Mortal Coils
is already urging us.

07:42.800 --> 07:43.780
I'll go right away.

07:45.800 --> 07:46.370
Mentor,

07:46.390 --> 07:48.170
you don't need to join the fuss.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.540
What if Senior gets punished?

07:49.560 --> 07:50.540
He might be whipped.

07:50.560 --> 07:52.140
You'd be crying your eyes out.

07:52.310 --> 07:52.660
Right?

07:52.680 --> 07:53.410
No, I...

07:53.430 --> 07:54.020
Freeze.

07:54.040 --> 07:54.700
Bye.

07:56.800 --> 07:58.020
Hey, at least give me a seat,

07:58.040 --> 07:58.930
so I can sit down.

07:59.190 --> 08:00.370
Let me get away

08:00.390 --> 08:01.290
from this furnace.

08:02.630 --> 08:03.780
It's so hot!

08:05.800 --> 08:07.850
[Hall of Mortal Coils]
Jiu Jiu of Griefbane Division

08:08.390 --> 08:10.050
is confined to the mountain

08:10.480 --> 08:13.340
and banned from wine for three years

08:14.000 --> 08:16.250
for drinking, slacking, and mishandling

08:16.630 --> 08:18.540
while leading a team
in North Land.

08:19.000 --> 08:19.780
Three years...

08:24.390 --> 08:25.700
I accept the punishment.

08:27.870 --> 08:29.250
Drinking truly ruins things.

08:33.080 --> 08:36.300
Uncle Jiu Wu is so powerful?

08:40.320 --> 08:41.460
Let me tell you.

08:41.630 --> 08:43.820
Among the nine disciples of Griefbane,

08:43.840 --> 08:46.220
Uncle Jiu Wu, ranked fifth,

08:46.440 --> 08:48.300
is the most well-connected.

08:48.630 --> 08:50.530
Before the Grandlord's seclusion,

08:50.550 --> 08:52.850
the Grandlord entrusted him
with many key affairs.

08:52.870 --> 08:54.850
Without such sharpness and skill,

08:54.870 --> 08:56.980
how could he become an elder?

08:57.390 --> 08:58.530
I always thought

08:58.550 --> 09:01.340
that he was a weiqi bum
who leaves on time.

09:03.150 --> 09:04.130
The Hall of Mortal Coils

09:04.360 --> 09:07.060
is the Ascendance Sect's affairs hub.

09:07.150 --> 09:08.700
To run the Hall of Mortal Coils

09:08.910 --> 09:11.130
is like handling the food and supplies,

09:11.240 --> 09:14.060
as well as rewards and punishments,

09:14.080 --> 09:17.340
of the 800 divisions.

09:17.550 --> 09:19.460
Any mistake spells disaster.

09:19.960 --> 09:20.730
Even so,

09:21.080 --> 09:23.220
he still plays weiqi with us.

09:23.360 --> 09:25.250
That's truly admirable.

09:32.840 --> 09:33.610
You see.

09:33.870 --> 09:34.610
Here's the thing.

09:34.630 --> 09:36.340
Next time you talk about me,

09:36.360 --> 09:38.890
could you drop the "weiqi bum" part?

09:38.910 --> 09:39.250
Yes, yes, yes.

09:39.270 --> 09:40.490
Yes, yes, yes.

09:42.030 --> 09:44.420
This matter won't end peacefully today.

09:44.440 --> 09:46.180
You'd better prepare yourself.

09:46.840 --> 09:48.220
Alright, go on now.

09:51.030 --> 09:52.250
Were you talking ill of me just now?

09:52.600 --> 09:53.850
No, not at all.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.940
Li Changshou!

10:13.030 --> 10:14.650
Pay with your life for my disciple!

10:15.440 --> 10:17.100
He is just a junior, weak and alone.

10:17.150 --> 10:19.890
How could he withstand
your strike?

10:20.000 --> 10:20.890
Weak?

10:21.550 --> 10:22.820
He's not weak at all.

10:22.840 --> 10:24.180
And there's something sinister
about him.

10:24.440 --> 10:27.730
Otherwise, how would Yuan Qing
fall into his hands?

10:28.670 --> 10:29.370
Uncle.

10:29.390 --> 10:31.300
Uncle, spare me! Uncle!

10:32.030 --> 10:33.250
My disciple Xuanya

10:33.360 --> 10:35.730
has reported
the full account of this case.

10:36.150 --> 10:38.220
Yuan Qing brought this upon himself.

10:38.240 --> 10:40.460
A one-sided story can hardly be trusted.

10:40.550 --> 10:42.220
Maybe Youqin Xuanya

10:42.240 --> 10:43.580
colluded with this kid

10:43.600 --> 10:44.820
to frame my disciple.

10:44.840 --> 10:45.610
Kuai Si!

10:46.030 --> 10:47.100
You're twisting the truth.

10:48.000 --> 10:48.940
Li Changshou,

10:50.080 --> 10:52.060
I don't think you can

10:52.480 --> 10:54.820
harm my disciple?

10:55.440 --> 10:57.180
If you confess honestly,

10:57.270 --> 10:59.130
I won't make things hard for you.

10:59.360 --> 11:00.460
Tell the truth!

11:00.480 --> 11:02.490
What role did Youqin Xuanya

11:02.630 --> 11:04.490
play in this case?

11:04.630 --> 11:05.980
Well, Kuai Si.

11:06.550 --> 11:07.940
While the Grandlord is away,

11:08.030 --> 11:09.820
you want to lead the Sect?

11:09.840 --> 11:11.420
Xuanya is virtuous and upright.

11:11.440 --> 11:13.420
Changshou is law-abiding.

11:13.440 --> 11:15.420
These two are no troublemakers.

11:15.440 --> 11:17.010
What if you misjudged them?

11:17.030 --> 11:17.580
You...

11:17.600 --> 11:19.460
Junior Kuai, speak plainly.

11:19.790 --> 11:21.700
How do you want to handle this?

11:21.840 --> 11:22.580
Good.

11:23.840 --> 11:25.580
That's exactly what I wanted to hear.

11:30.840 --> 11:31.250
Li Changshou.

11:31.270 --> 11:32.010
This is...

11:32.440 --> 11:35.010
Dare you test this Flameheart Stone?

11:35.510 --> 11:37.730
This stone hasn't been used
in a century.

11:37.790 --> 11:39.460
You want to extract
Li Changshou's memory?

11:39.480 --> 11:40.370
Exactly.

11:40.630 --> 11:43.220
I want him to bare his soul in public

11:43.240 --> 11:44.770
and expose his secrets.

11:44.870 --> 11:46.580
Uncle, must it come to this?

11:46.790 --> 11:47.130
I...

11:47.150 --> 11:48.530
The Flameheart Stone

11:48.960 --> 11:50.730
has always been our sect's method

11:50.750 --> 11:52.420
for interrogating criminals.

11:53.240 --> 11:55.820
Li Changshou, if your testimony

11:55.840 --> 11:58.130
doesn't match your memory,

11:59.360 --> 12:02.650
your heart will suffer scorching pain.

12:02.870 --> 12:04.490
That is going too far.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.850
You insist on shielding

12:06.870 --> 12:08.980
the evildoer at every turn.

12:09.080 --> 12:12.940
I have no other choice.

12:13.200 --> 12:14.530
The Flameheart Stone

12:14.550 --> 12:17.370
may reveal one's private thoughts.

12:17.750 --> 12:20.420
You would make Changshou

12:20.440 --> 12:21.980
lay bare every thought before all,

12:22.000 --> 12:23.730
to be stripped and judged.

12:23.750 --> 12:26.010
How is he to face himself after this?

12:26.030 --> 12:26.770
Exactly.

12:27.550 --> 12:28.340
That's right.

12:29.870 --> 12:31.820
It must be before all eyes.

12:33.150 --> 12:33.940
You...

12:38.630 --> 12:40.130
Disciples outside the hall, listen.

12:40.270 --> 12:41.580
Bear witness together.

12:42.600 --> 12:44.370
Let us see what this disciple

12:44.600 --> 12:46.460
of Jade Division truly is.

12:52.460 --> 12:55.140
[Enlighten and Clear]

13:00.240 --> 13:01.250
Senior,

13:01.910 --> 13:03.180
I'm sorry.

13:27.630 --> 13:28.610
It's not contagious.

13:36.790 --> 13:38.100
Senior,

13:38.120 --> 13:39.850
don't overdo it now.

13:48.670 --> 13:49.980
Spring has come.

13:50.240 --> 13:53.220
It's mating season for the wolves again.

13:53.240 --> 13:53.850
Stop.

13:55.600 --> 13:58.220
I said to recall, not to compose poetry.

13:59.120 --> 14:01.370
That was my inner voice at the time.

14:01.390 --> 14:02.370
I can't shake it off.

14:04.630 --> 14:05.490
Go on.

14:05.510 --> 14:06.220
Okay.

14:09.270 --> 14:10.580
Yuan Qing of Mistveil Division,

14:10.670 --> 14:12.060
my perfect Senior.

14:12.080 --> 14:14.250
He honors his mentor and the Way.

14:14.390 --> 14:16.370
Even if my mentor were here,

14:16.480 --> 14:18.100
it'd be nothing special.

14:18.200 --> 14:20.250
He's long been of no use.

14:26.480 --> 14:28.530
He can bend and stretch.

14:30.510 --> 14:32.580
A last struggle.

14:32.910 --> 14:35.130
Junior Changshou, please.

14:35.630 --> 14:36.820
Please save me.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.980
He is pure and detached.

14:39.030 --> 14:41.850
A male disciple assaulted
a female disciple,

14:41.870 --> 14:44.420
and they both perished.

14:44.440 --> 14:47.130
That's my clan's grand wish.

14:51.000 --> 14:53.130
He owns his actions.

14:53.270 --> 14:54.060
Indeed.

14:55.120 --> 14:57.890
Yuwen Ling is indeed my accomplice.

15:03.480 --> 15:05.980
He's concerned for others.

15:06.270 --> 15:07.850
I wonder how Xuanya is faring.

15:08.840 --> 15:10.370
If she is safe and sound,

15:10.390 --> 15:11.370
how can I

15:12.200 --> 15:14.250
rest easy?

15:16.670 --> 15:18.650
I wasted my regard on Yuan Qing.

15:18.670 --> 15:19.010
Pah.

15:19.390 --> 15:21.010
We can't judge the book by its cover.

15:21.080 --> 15:23.490
Yes, yes, yes.

15:23.510 --> 15:24.250
Xuanya,

15:24.510 --> 15:26.010
is that really what happened?

15:27.000 --> 15:29.770
So, Yuan Qing's words
can be read like this.

15:30.480 --> 15:32.010
Senior sees the truth in details.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.850
Truly a model for us all.

15:33.910 --> 15:35.530
This man is absolutely disgusting.

15:37.630 --> 15:39.490
Sister, Aunt, you don't know.

15:39.670 --> 15:42.010
In this world, there exists a supreme,

15:42.200 --> 15:44.580
mystical art.

15:44.840 --> 15:46.060
What mystical art?

15:46.080 --> 15:47.490
I've never heard of it.
Tell us about it.

15:47.870 --> 15:50.420
It is called the Montage Art.

16:03.120 --> 16:03.890
Junior.

16:03.910 --> 16:05.460
My mentor has a secret.

16:05.480 --> 16:07.180
I can't take it to the grave.

16:07.200 --> 16:08.460
Do you want to know?

16:13.150 --> 16:13.940
Wretched creature!

16:14.390 --> 16:15.370
Even death is too lenient.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.220
What are you all looking at?

16:17.240 --> 16:18.220
All of you, leave!

16:20.080 --> 16:22.130
Alright, now it's quite clear.

16:22.790 --> 16:23.890
Yuan Qing

16:24.080 --> 16:26.180
got what he deserved.

16:26.200 --> 16:28.980
In contrast, Xuanya and Changshou,

16:29.000 --> 16:29.980
in times of peril,

16:30.320 --> 16:31.650
stayed true to their hearts.

16:31.670 --> 16:33.650
They're not only blameless,
but meritorious.

16:34.510 --> 16:35.370
I'm ashamed.

16:36.000 --> 16:37.490
Deeply ashamed.

16:38.840 --> 16:39.610
Changshou,

16:40.360 --> 16:41.130
it seems

16:41.720 --> 16:43.650
I owe you a proper apology.

16:43.670 --> 16:44.940
No, no need, Uncle.

16:45.000 --> 16:45.770
Changshou,

16:46.480 --> 16:47.980
before Yuan Qing died,

16:48.870 --> 16:50.580
what secret did he tell you?

16:50.790 --> 16:51.770
What secret?

16:52.960 --> 16:53.730
He told me...

16:53.870 --> 16:55.370
He did say something.

16:55.390 --> 16:56.180
What did he say?

16:56.390 --> 16:57.300
He said...

16:58.840 --> 16:59.820
He said...

16:59.840 --> 17:00.180
He...

17:07.270 --> 17:08.050
Then...

17:08.070 --> 17:08.940
And then?

17:09.240 --> 17:10.050
Then...

17:11.790 --> 17:13.660
Then the python swallowed him.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.420
The python...

17:17.440 --> 17:20.330
Did he leave anything behind?

17:20.480 --> 17:21.700
Anything you took?

17:21.720 --> 17:23.140
Such as?

17:24.270 --> 17:25.700
Magic instruments, hidden weapons.

17:26.270 --> 17:27.290
What?

17:32.240 --> 17:34.010
Magic instruments, hidden weapons.

17:34.270 --> 17:35.380
Magic instruments, hidden weapons?

17:37.030 --> 17:37.860
No, no.

17:38.000 --> 17:38.660
Truly?

17:38.830 --> 17:39.620
Truly none.

17:39.640 --> 17:41.050
Had I found any magic instruments
or weapons,

17:41.070 --> 17:42.530
I'd return them with both hands.

17:44.270 --> 17:46.290
What an honest man you are.

17:48.310 --> 17:50.050
They all say you're honest.

17:50.070 --> 17:51.090
Yes, yes, honest.

17:51.110 --> 17:51.490
Move aside.

17:51.510 --> 17:52.250
Yes, yes.

17:53.790 --> 17:55.570
But I know

17:55.880 --> 17:57.770
that no one settles
for just being honest.

17:58.880 --> 17:59.700
It's just

18:00.440 --> 18:04.570
they haven't met the right price, right?

18:04.590 --> 18:05.420
Price?

18:05.720 --> 18:06.660
What price?

18:07.480 --> 18:09.090
You're as foolish as your mentor.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.090
To be in the same sect as you

18:10.110 --> 18:11.730
is truly my disgrace.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.050
Uncle.

18:14.070 --> 18:15.090
Uncle, I remember now.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.490
I think I had a belt.

18:16.510 --> 18:18.090
But it seems I dropped it.

18:20.400 --> 18:22.010
Why are you still frowning?

18:22.030 --> 18:23.330
What are your concerns?

18:25.440 --> 18:27.050
There's one thing I don't understand.

18:27.880 --> 18:29.380
Within the Miasma Grove,

18:29.880 --> 18:31.900
beasts clash; their life is short.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.660
No such python should be born here.

18:35.270 --> 18:36.980
This python is suspicious.

18:37.920 --> 18:40.700
It seems like a pet raised by someone.

18:41.070 --> 18:41.980
If it was raised

18:42.070 --> 18:45.380
by the Human Sect,

18:45.400 --> 18:46.330
that would be one thing.

18:46.480 --> 18:47.490
What I fear

18:49.480 --> 18:51.570
is it's linked to our dear neighbors.

18:51.880 --> 18:52.940
You mean...

18:54.070 --> 18:54.660
Dragons?

19:08.700 --> 19:11.460
[Dragon Palace of the East Sea]

19:26.640 --> 19:27.420
Bao'er.

19:30.070 --> 19:30.860
Bao'er...

19:32.440 --> 19:34.220
I raised Bao'er for ten years,

19:36.400 --> 19:37.490
and now it's dead.

19:39.240 --> 19:40.180
Who did this?

19:40.260 --> 19:41.660
[Yecha, Dragon General]

19:41.860 --> 19:43.140
[Jinli, Dragon General]

19:43.270 --> 19:44.140
Say it.

19:46.270 --> 19:47.180
It's over.

19:52.720 --> 19:54.330
Ascendance Sect!

19:56.070 --> 19:57.180
I have verified.

19:57.510 --> 19:58.660
Jingwei Island and Miasma Grove

19:58.680 --> 20:00.900
are both Ascendance Sect's
training grounds this time.

20:02.070 --> 20:03.090
Your Highness, please calm down.

20:07.110 --> 20:08.290
They injured my shrimp soldiers,

20:09.240 --> 20:10.490
harmed my crab generals,

20:10.490 --> 20:12.920
[Ao Jia, First Prince of East Sea]

20:12.920 --> 20:14.620
and killed my beloved pet Bao'er.

20:16.510 --> 20:17.940
This is an outrage!

20:22.310 --> 20:22.900
Who?

20:23.680 --> 20:24.460
Good.

20:26.480 --> 20:27.250
Very good.

20:28.310 --> 20:29.460
Good, good.

20:35.780 --> 20:39.620
[Ao Guang, Dragon King of East Sea]

20:40.110 --> 20:40.700
Good.

20:41.880 --> 20:43.290
Enough with that, Father.

20:43.590 --> 20:44.620
Those scoundrels

20:44.790 --> 20:46.460
are about to dump all over us.

20:46.480 --> 20:47.090
Stop

20:47.640 --> 20:48.620
saying that.

20:50.590 --> 20:51.980
They're about to dump?

20:52.400 --> 20:53.770
That means they haven't dumped yet.

20:54.510 --> 20:55.700
Since they haven't dumped yet,

20:55.720 --> 20:58.250
it's still human-dragon harmony.

20:58.270 --> 20:59.010
What's wrong with that?

20:59.030 --> 20:59.700
They...

20:59.720 --> 21:00.490
Enough.

21:02.240 --> 21:03.050
Jia,

21:03.200 --> 21:05.420
for the greater good, just bear with it.

21:06.400 --> 21:08.810
[Turtle Minister]
Your foresight is unmatched.

21:11.680 --> 21:13.530
Yes, only Father has great vision.

21:14.070 --> 21:15.570
And I'm the petty one.

21:16.110 --> 21:18.810
It seems Jia is still upset.

21:18.880 --> 21:19.490
Perfect timing.

21:20.070 --> 21:21.250
I have an errand for you.

21:21.270 --> 21:23.660
Take a trip to cheer yourself up.

21:24.160 --> 21:24.940
Father,

21:25.440 --> 21:27.530
I'm in no mood for any official duties.

21:28.350 --> 21:29.090
I'm not going.

21:40.640 --> 21:41.490
If I send you

21:43.270 --> 21:45.220
to the Ascendance Sect?

21:45.240 --> 21:46.460
The Ascendance Sect? I...

21:49.200 --> 21:49.980
The Ascendance Sect?

21:54.110 --> 21:54.860
Sure.

21:55.480 --> 21:56.250
Good.

22:04.000 --> 22:05.180
Judging by your expression,

22:05.200 --> 22:07.010
I guess it was a close call.

22:07.400 --> 22:08.700
You don't understand.

22:09.240 --> 22:10.700
We Three Pure Ones disciples

22:10.920 --> 22:13.050
always wear the same expression.

22:14.510 --> 22:15.490
Not at all.

22:16.000 --> 22:18.050
Kuai Si always has such a sour face,

22:18.070 --> 22:19.570
as if someone owes him money.

22:21.480 --> 22:23.140
Today, Kuai Si was arrogant and rude.

22:23.480 --> 22:25.010
His cunning was on full display.

22:25.790 --> 22:27.050
We'll put stability first.

22:27.070 --> 22:28.770
Don't get tangled up with him.

22:29.070 --> 22:30.050
What?

22:30.070 --> 22:31.810
You clearly had it easy.

22:31.830 --> 22:33.050
You had him under control.

22:33.680 --> 22:34.700
Not really.

22:36.070 --> 22:36.940
Do you know

22:37.480 --> 22:39.380
why Mentor fell so hard back then?

22:39.720 --> 22:40.530
I do.

22:41.400 --> 22:42.420
I heard that back then, Mentor

22:42.440 --> 22:43.980
was originally a top immortal seedling.

22:44.000 --> 22:45.620
He even surpassed Kuai Si.

22:45.640 --> 22:46.220
Unfortunately,

22:46.240 --> 22:48.290
at the Training Assembly 60 years ago,

22:48.310 --> 22:49.420
an accident happened,

22:49.680 --> 22:52.660
which ruined his foundation
and hope for ascension.

22:55.270 --> 22:56.330
Ruined his foundation?

22:58.270 --> 22:59.180
The Gnatsting Needle?

22:59.350 --> 23:00.140
Exactly.

23:01.830 --> 23:03.140
In that trip to the Miasma Forest,

23:03.480 --> 23:05.220
Mentor and Kuai Si went together.

23:06.030 --> 23:07.490
I just found out now

23:08.070 --> 23:10.570
that it was a plot.

23:13.110 --> 23:14.490
The Mistveil Division!

23:15.000 --> 23:16.660
So, it's a tradition.

23:16.680 --> 23:17.980
I'm going to avenge Mentor.

23:18.830 --> 23:20.940
Didn't we agree to steady?

23:21.310 --> 23:22.380
You want more scripture copying?

23:22.400 --> 23:24.220
But our mentor was bullied.
How can we ignore it?

23:31.000 --> 23:31.900
A thousand times.

23:32.030 --> 23:33.050
A thousand times?

23:35.240 --> 23:36.810
I'll get Mentor to write it for me.

23:39.880 --> 23:40.700
Alchemy Chamber?

23:41.070 --> 23:42.420
Mentor, I'm here!

23:42.680 --> 23:43.530
Alchemy Chamber?

23:45.030 --> 23:45.810
Alchemy Chamber!

23:52.510 --> 23:53.250
My pill!

23:53.310 --> 23:54.160
Mentor! Mentor!

23:54.160 --> 23:55.330
- My pill!
- Mentor.

23:55.350 --> 23:56.490
- Mentor, where are you?
- Elixir!

24:05.830 --> 24:06.460
Freeze!

24:08.160 --> 24:08.660
Mentor.

24:09.510 --> 24:10.250
My pill.

24:10.270 --> 24:11.180
Mentor! Mentor!

24:14.440 --> 24:15.140
Mentor.

24:15.920 --> 24:16.980
Senior, don't eat it!

24:26.030 --> 24:27.460
Senior, wake up! Senior!

24:27.480 --> 24:28.010
Senior.

24:33.550 --> 24:34.330
Where is this?

24:38.420 --> 24:41.380
[South Heavenly Gate]

24:41.440 --> 24:42.620
South Heavenly Gate.

24:42.960 --> 24:44.570
I'm at the Celestial Court.

24:48.240 --> 24:49.380
Celestial Court.

25:30.880 --> 25:31.730
Celestial Court.

25:32.880 --> 25:33.570
I'm here...

25:37.640 --> 25:38.380
too early?

25:52.750 --> 25:55.090
It looks
like it hasn't been delivered yet.

25:59.750 --> 26:00.620
But that's fine.

26:02.350 --> 26:04.490
Pre-IPO shares are always like this.

26:04.510 --> 26:07.090
Senior! Senior!

26:07.110 --> 26:08.660
Senior, wake up! Wake up!

26:08.960 --> 26:10.380
Senior! Senior!

26:11.030 --> 26:11.810
Senior!

26:13.860 --> 26:15.780
[Hall of Soaring Heaven,
Celestial Court]

26:15.790 --> 26:17.810
Come on, say something.

26:18.550 --> 26:21.330
Where did His Majesty sneak off to now?

26:21.720 --> 26:23.730
There are still so many memorials left.

26:23.750 --> 26:25.250
Hurry, find him!

26:29.140 --> 26:32.980
[Eastwood Duke, Tier II Deity]

26:43.240 --> 26:45.140
What is going on
in the Marriage Division?

26:45.160 --> 26:46.290
Go tell the Moon Elder

26:46.550 --> 26:48.700
that without more mortal couples,

26:48.750 --> 26:50.900
I'll demote him to Flaming Mountains
as an Earth Deity.

26:53.920 --> 26:55.620
Your Majesty.

26:56.000 --> 26:58.250
Your Majesty, please come back!

26:58.270 --> 26:59.620
I'm worn out.

26:59.750 --> 27:01.090
Your Majesty, where are you?

27:01.110 --> 27:01.900
Eastwood Duke.

27:02.350 --> 27:03.660
- Your Majesty.
- Eastwood Duke.

27:03.960 --> 27:04.980
- Eastwood Duke.
- Your Majesty...

27:05.200 --> 27:05.900
Eastwood Duke.

27:07.240 --> 27:07.770
So early in the morning,

27:09.720 --> 27:10.380
practicing your voice?

27:10.400 --> 27:11.660
You're the one practicing!

27:11.860 --> 27:13.000
[Moon Elder, Chief of Marriage Division]

27:13.000 --> 27:15.700
This is this month's Book of Marriages.

27:18.680 --> 27:20.090
It didn't meet the quota again?

27:20.920 --> 27:21.980
Well.

27:22.000 --> 27:23.860
Young people these days

27:23.880 --> 27:24.620
are all busy.

27:25.110 --> 27:26.620
They have to buy horses,

27:26.640 --> 27:29.050
acquire land, and get betrothal gifts.

27:29.240 --> 27:31.810
They don't have much desire to marry.

27:31.880 --> 27:32.660
You don't understand.

27:34.680 --> 27:36.180
Don't give me all these excuses.

27:36.440 --> 27:38.770
You've been short on
human vitality for months.

27:39.000 --> 27:40.900
If the Three Realms don't thrive,

27:40.960 --> 27:43.180
how will the Celestial Court
get its incense?

27:43.200 --> 27:43.900
You tell me.

27:44.160 --> 27:45.090
Well.

27:45.110 --> 27:46.530
Though I oversee

27:46.550 --> 27:48.460
the Human Sect's marriages,

27:48.640 --> 27:50.380
love, you see,

27:50.400 --> 27:51.530
can't be rushed.

27:51.920 --> 27:53.460
Do you even know what love is?

27:54.240 --> 27:56.380
Do you even know what love is?

27:56.880 --> 27:58.660
Love, you know,

27:58.720 --> 28:01.250
is about the fortune
of love and affinity.

28:01.270 --> 28:03.570
It depends on their compatibility score

28:03.790 --> 28:06.140
and if they like what they see.

28:06.160 --> 28:07.530
I don't like what I see.

28:07.680 --> 28:08.860
Stop nagging me.

28:08.920 --> 28:10.570
If you don't meet the quota this month,

28:10.590 --> 28:12.140
I'll ruin you.

28:21.060 --> 28:24.500
[Monthly Number of Couples]

28:24.500 --> 28:26.060
[Early Spring: 225, Mid Spring: 201,
Late Spring: 160]

28:34.880 --> 28:36.180
Senior, Senior.

28:37.750 --> 28:38.770
Wait for me, Senior.

28:39.790 --> 28:40.530
One, two, three.

28:40.830 --> 28:41.290
Go!

28:45.200 --> 28:45.980
What the...?

28:49.480 --> 28:50.490
Senior, you're finally awake.

28:50.510 --> 28:52.250
I almost thought you'd pass away.

28:52.270 --> 28:53.860
I was indeed about to.

28:54.310 --> 28:55.090
However...

28:55.570 --> 28:57.660
Moon Elder, human vitality.

28:58.030 --> 28:59.770
So, this is the shortcut to the heavens.

29:00.200 --> 29:01.220
Isn't it simply about marriages?

29:01.510 --> 29:02.770
I'll lend him a hand.

29:03.510 --> 29:04.570
If this is done,

29:04.750 --> 29:06.140
it will be a great merit for me.

29:06.160 --> 29:08.730
I'll find my place
in the Celestial Court.

29:13.550 --> 29:14.330
Mentor!

29:14.680 --> 29:16.050
Senior, our mentor is here.

29:16.070 --> 29:16.700
Mentor!

29:17.310 --> 29:19.220
My pill!

29:22.940 --> 29:27.500
[Hall of Virtue]

29:39.550 --> 29:40.730
Since you're here,

29:42.510 --> 29:44.570
show yourself quickly.

29:47.900 --> 29:53.340
[Wen Jing, Gnat Master of Blood Sea]

29:57.510 --> 29:58.940
Elder Kuai,

30:01.070 --> 30:02.810
you're truly becoming more

30:03.750 --> 30:05.460
and more extraordinary.

30:07.200 --> 30:08.810
Wicked heretic.

30:09.030 --> 30:11.010
Don't push your luck.

30:14.550 --> 30:16.220
Thanks for the compliment.

30:16.400 --> 30:18.730
But it's heretics like us

30:18.880 --> 30:20.770
who can help you get what you want.

30:23.030 --> 30:25.460
If Yuan Qing hadn't bungled things

30:26.400 --> 30:28.980
and nearly dragged me down,

30:29.440 --> 30:30.900
why would I need you?

30:31.350 --> 30:32.180
What a pity.

30:33.160 --> 30:33.940
Originally,

30:33.960 --> 30:36.330
I even hoped to befriend him.

30:38.640 --> 30:39.570
Ridiculous.

30:40.030 --> 30:41.330
You're a demon.

30:42.640 --> 30:43.860
Why talk of friendship?

30:47.830 --> 30:48.860
How annoying.

30:52.400 --> 30:53.810
I've staked everything

30:55.880 --> 30:57.570
on you.

30:58.000 --> 30:59.770
I've given you the Gnatsting Needle,

30:59.960 --> 31:01.980
and in time, I'll eliminate your rivals.

31:02.240 --> 31:04.900
That's deep affection, isn't it?

31:05.160 --> 31:06.860
Don't flatter yourself.

31:07.000 --> 31:07.940
Let me ask you.

31:08.030 --> 31:09.810
Yuan Qing used the Gnatsting Needle.

31:09.830 --> 31:11.620
Why didn't it work?

31:15.510 --> 31:16.620
This treasure

31:17.550 --> 31:19.530
isn't something just anyone can use.

31:31.590 --> 31:33.900
Don't take it out lightly again.

31:34.240 --> 31:37.140
If that Jade disciple knows
about the Gnatsting Needle,

31:37.160 --> 31:38.090
once you act,

31:40.590 --> 31:42.700
it'll reveal our connection.

31:47.640 --> 31:49.490
You're indeed cautious.

31:52.070 --> 31:53.090
About that matter,

31:54.110 --> 31:55.490
will you agree,

31:56.880 --> 31:58.290
or not?

32:02.030 --> 32:03.420
I need more time

32:03.920 --> 32:06.530
to consider it.

32:10.000 --> 32:11.620
I've waited sixty years.

32:12.310 --> 32:13.660
A few more days won't matter.

32:17.640 --> 32:18.980
Don't be impatient.

32:19.480 --> 32:22.420
The Grandlord is old and in seclusion.

32:23.480 --> 32:26.420
In power, I may not lose.

32:27.830 --> 32:28.730
Once you

32:29.720 --> 32:31.900
help me take control,

32:32.590 --> 32:33.770
at that time,

32:34.070 --> 32:37.250
what can't we do?

32:37.400 --> 32:38.810
Then I wish you

32:39.680 --> 32:41.900
a swift rise to the top.

32:50.140 --> 32:52.420
[Jade Division]

32:52.790 --> 32:53.630
[Wang Qi, Spiritkin Division]
There are Wang Qi

32:53.630 --> 32:54.640
[Liu Yan'er, Gravecap Division]
and Liu Yan'er.

32:55.110 --> 32:57.010
They both know,

32:57.030 --> 32:58.140
unable to speak their hearts.

32:58.510 --> 32:59.220
That's all of them.

33:00.720 --> 33:01.570
But Senior,

33:01.640 --> 33:03.380
you always said to avoid karma.

33:03.400 --> 33:05.050
Why suddenly play matchmaker?

33:05.240 --> 33:07.250
What joy to bring lovers together!

33:08.790 --> 33:09.940
Have you gone mad on that vine?

33:10.200 --> 33:11.420
You're the mad one!

33:12.400 --> 33:14.700
My soul drifted into Ninth Heaven.

33:14.720 --> 33:15.940
A deity there enlightened me.

33:15.960 --> 33:18.620
I vowed to make the Human Sect flourish.

33:18.640 --> 33:19.770
How can that be called madness?

33:19.790 --> 33:20.810
It is indeed madness.

33:22.030 --> 33:22.900
But Senior,

33:22.920 --> 33:25.460
it is just as you said.

33:25.640 --> 33:27.660
Everyone has someone in their heart.

33:27.750 --> 33:30.140
Yet none dare take that step.

33:30.790 --> 33:34.620
Junior, it is a long story.

33:35.240 --> 33:38.420
Our sect is a Human Sect branch.

33:38.440 --> 33:41.380
Yet cultivators don't get married.

33:41.400 --> 33:44.900
Cultivation and love
oppose each other by nature.

33:45.200 --> 33:49.490
Deeper cultivation dulls the heart.

33:54.110 --> 33:55.330
Indeed, Senior.

33:55.590 --> 33:56.380
But

33:56.680 --> 33:59.250
I can't bear to see all our sect mates

33:59.270 --> 34:01.290
end up old, alone,

34:01.400 --> 34:03.810
and full of regret,

34:03.830 --> 34:06.220
just like my mentor.

34:06.550 --> 34:07.940
Mentor once fell in love?

34:10.230 --> 34:11.780
It's a long story.

34:13.190 --> 34:13.980
She was

34:14.110 --> 34:15.490
our mentor's senior

34:15.510 --> 34:16.980
and also our aunt.

34:17.190 --> 34:18.740
They say they both entered the sect

34:18.760 --> 34:20.170
under Grand-mentor on the same day.

34:20.670 --> 34:21.900
We actually have an aunt?

34:21.920 --> 34:22.900
How come I didn't know?

34:23.230 --> 34:25.010
I saw it in the records

34:25.030 --> 34:26.420
of the Hall of Mortal Coils.

34:27.630 --> 34:30.090
Our aunt is called Wan Jiangyu.

34:30.110 --> 34:33.090
She and Mentor were deeply in love then.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.490
But since Mentor had

34:34.510 --> 34:35.820
that problem during his training,

34:35.840 --> 34:37.940
Aunt Wan disappeared without a trace.

34:39.590 --> 34:41.300
Don't tell anyone about this.

34:42.550 --> 34:43.860
I see.

34:45.190 --> 34:47.980
Whenever Mentor

34:48.000 --> 34:49.740
is near death and delirious,

34:50.000 --> 34:52.050
he always says Aunt Wan's name.

34:53.760 --> 34:55.570
Love in this world

34:55.800 --> 34:58.210
truly binds us in life.

34:58.880 --> 34:59.650
Senior,

34:59.800 --> 35:01.860
you're so romantic when you go mad!

35:02.400 --> 35:03.260
So,

35:03.510 --> 35:04.650
we must save

35:04.670 --> 35:06.780
all the countless lovers in the world.

35:09.030 --> 35:10.050
Then, what should we do?

35:10.760 --> 35:13.260
They just need a spark.

35:13.320 --> 35:15.610
[Ambition Pill]
It's it!

35:15.760 --> 35:16.740
Anyone who takes this pill

35:16.760 --> 35:19.490
will find it hard to restrain themselves

35:19.590 --> 35:20.900
until they break through all obstacles

35:20.920 --> 35:22.570
and charge forward bravely for love.

35:23.190 --> 35:23.980
However,

35:24.360 --> 35:26.050
since it's too expensive,

35:26.150 --> 35:28.130
I only brought back an empty bottle.

35:28.150 --> 35:30.460
Yet the ingredients are hard to find.

35:32.480 --> 35:33.610
Senior, don't worry.

35:33.880 --> 35:34.740
I'll go pick them.

35:36.960 --> 35:39.570
What a good junior. She catches on fast.

35:39.620 --> 35:40.940
[Good Luck, Certain Victory]

35:49.290 --> 35:51.280
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

35:51.570 --> 35:53.500
♪I dare to live my own way♪

35:53.500 --> 35:55.850
♪In the Primordial World♪

35:55.850 --> 35:57.610
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

35:57.970 --> 36:00.130
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

36:00.300 --> 36:02.320
♪Roaming the city with reckless courage♪

36:02.480 --> 36:04.480
♪Just watching swordplay while drunk♪

36:04.480 --> 36:06.260
♪And in dreams, I reign supreme♪

36:06.520 --> 36:08.500
♪Who can ever♪

36:08.670 --> 36:10.570
♪Predict the clock of time♪

36:10.880 --> 36:13.330
♪Learn the watches of the night♪

36:13.330 --> 36:15.010
♪The hearth smoke rises high♪

36:15.240 --> 36:17.540
♪Let the comings and goings be♪

36:17.540 --> 36:19.680
[Steady]

36:19.680 --> 36:21.040
♪A varied life♪

36:25.190 --> 36:27.650
He is Wang Qi of Spiritkin Division.

36:27.840 --> 36:29.130
A passionate wanderer.

36:29.400 --> 36:30.980
Head over heels for her.

36:33.280 --> 36:34.380
I've met

36:34.800 --> 36:36.460
Junior Yan'er a few times.

36:37.590 --> 36:39.690
We got along quite well.

36:41.550 --> 36:44.170
She's Liu Yan'er of Gravecap Division.

36:44.550 --> 36:47.570
Sincere feelings, pining away.

36:47.800 --> 36:49.010
Wang Qi only talks to me

36:49.840 --> 36:53.090
about Spirit Treasures and elixirs.

36:53.190 --> 36:54.740
What a blockhead.

36:56.400 --> 36:57.170
Maybe...

36:57.760 --> 36:58.570
Perhaps...

36:58.880 --> 36:59.650
It seems...

37:00.030 --> 37:00.820
Probably...

37:03.000 --> 37:04.260
A bit of that going on.

37:04.400 --> 37:06.090
If I hadn't fallen for him,

37:07.150 --> 37:08.780
I wouldn't listen to his lectures.

37:10.760 --> 37:12.690
It's not that I won't confess.

37:12.800 --> 37:14.010
It's just our sect

37:14.670 --> 37:19.980
values purity and self-restraint.

37:21.550 --> 37:22.650
Forgive me.

37:22.670 --> 37:23.980
If I keep fretting,

37:24.320 --> 37:25.980
it will delay my cultivation.

37:26.000 --> 37:27.650
How can I speak

37:29.920 --> 37:31.780
of such matters of the heart?

37:34.720 --> 37:36.940
♪Not knowing what love truly is♪

37:39.030 --> 37:40.420
How should two lovers kept apart

37:40.440 --> 37:41.940
break the impasse?

37:42.030 --> 37:44.860
Don't worry. The Ambition Pill will act.

37:49.440 --> 37:52.010
Why, why?

37:52.320 --> 37:54.980
A strange heat rises in my chest.

37:56.150 --> 37:57.260
Could it be...

37:57.800 --> 37:59.780
Love around the corner?

38:00.320 --> 38:03.570
We'll grow old at the world's end.

38:04.360 --> 38:07.980
In this life, forever side by side.

38:08.760 --> 38:10.940
Ambition Pill, 9,999.

38:10.960 --> 38:13.420
Two a day, hand in hand.

38:14.110 --> 38:14.980
Great.

38:15.000 --> 38:16.690
Great.

38:20.670 --> 38:22.650
[Ambition Pill]
One of a kind.

38:22.670 --> 38:24.820
Three lifetimes of new experience.

38:24.880 --> 38:26.940
Those who have companions
can kindle their love.

38:27.000 --> 38:29.260
Those who don't can remold your fate.

38:29.280 --> 38:30.860
Mentors, friends, and kin,

38:30.880 --> 38:33.050
don't pass this by.

38:34.960 --> 38:37.170
If no one buys it,

38:37.280 --> 38:39.380
the path to immortality narrows.

38:39.920 --> 38:42.380
If we all take one,

38:42.550 --> 38:45.300
sincerity fills the sect's gate.

38:46.230 --> 38:47.420
I want some!

38:47.960 --> 38:48.690
Come, come!

38:48.710 --> 38:49.010
Give me, give me!

38:49.030 --> 38:49.530
Pay first.

38:49.550 --> 38:50.690
Money, money, pay first.

38:50.710 --> 38:51.460
Where's your money?

38:51.480 --> 38:52.010
I'll take one.

38:52.230 --> 38:53.210
Outrageous!

38:54.400 --> 38:56.380
How dare you set up a stall here!

38:56.960 --> 38:57.780
Shut it down!

38:57.800 --> 38:59.610
You two, shut it down!

39:01.320 --> 39:02.820
I'll take them all!

39:05.360 --> 39:06.940
These are all Spirit Treasure coins.

39:07.510 --> 39:09.300
Senior, what do you think?

39:13.880 --> 39:15.090
You've memorized

39:15.110 --> 39:17.820
all those years of marketing tips.

39:18.710 --> 39:19.940
Your pursuing immortality

39:19.960 --> 39:22.300
has caused a huge loss
to the cunning merchants' world.

39:22.760 --> 39:24.340
When it comes to scheming,

39:24.360 --> 39:26.010
I'm no better than you.

39:26.400 --> 39:27.570
But when it comes to scheming for money,

39:28.590 --> 39:29.740
I'm the best.

39:32.030 --> 39:33.380
Later, give some Ambition Pills

39:33.800 --> 39:35.650
to Uncle Jiu Wu too.

39:35.670 --> 39:36.650
Without his leniency,

39:37.000 --> 39:39.050
our small business couldn't survive.

39:39.440 --> 39:40.300
I won't forget.

39:40.440 --> 39:41.610
But he probably doesn't need it.

39:42.320 --> 39:43.090
Maybe.

39:46.070 --> 39:47.690
Senior, what are you doing?

39:48.190 --> 39:49.570
Waiting for the effect.

39:49.670 --> 39:50.980
Waiting for the effect?

39:55.880 --> 39:57.300
What effect are you waiting for?

39:58.550 --> 39:59.820
An effect you wouldn't understand.

40:04.320 --> 40:05.650
So, Senior,

40:06.110 --> 40:07.690
how's the effect on you now?

40:09.190 --> 40:11.300
Still no results.

40:11.590 --> 40:12.570
Still no...

40:15.900 --> 40:17.420
[Ambition Pill]

40:24.550 --> 40:25.340
Senior,

40:25.590 --> 40:28.860
maybe it's in your head?

40:30.070 --> 40:31.300
Look, lately,

40:31.320 --> 40:33.530
the sect's been all romantic.

40:33.710 --> 40:34.650
It's quite moving.

40:34.670 --> 40:36.260
Even I can't help...

40:43.630 --> 40:44.420
Senior,

40:44.590 --> 40:46.380
I think you worry about others

40:46.400 --> 40:47.380
way too much.

40:47.400 --> 40:49.740
You should worry about yourself too.

40:50.710 --> 40:54.570
A devoted beauty like me

40:54.800 --> 40:56.010
is rare to find.

40:56.030 --> 40:58.090
This opportunity won't come again.

40:59.280 --> 41:00.780
Is it not enough?

41:01.480 --> 41:02.380
Not enough...

41:02.960 --> 41:03.460
I...

41:05.710 --> 41:06.460
I understand.

41:06.670 --> 41:07.300
Wait for me.

41:08.710 --> 41:09.570
What?

41:11.400 --> 41:14.380
Why no word from Moon Elder?

41:15.110 --> 41:15.650
Hello?

41:16.840 --> 41:17.420
Hello, hello?

41:50.260 --> 41:56.040
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

41:56.710 --> 42:03.410
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

42:04.940 --> 42:10.990
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

42:11.620 --> 42:18.070
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

42:18.810 --> 42:25.930
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:26.310 --> 42:33.210
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:33.590 --> 42:40.940
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

42:40.940 --> 42:48.110
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

43:04.250 --> 43:09.420
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

43:10.510 --> 43:17.530
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

43:18.720 --> 43:24.660
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

43:25.360 --> 43:32.440
♪Alas, our story is short♪

43:32.780 --> 43:39.890
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:40.210 --> 43:46.690
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:47.470 --> 43:54.680
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

43:55.070 --> 44:02.890
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
